    name = "Power management controller (PMC)";
    desc = "Power management controller (PMC) of the Hi3521A/Hi3520D V300 at base 0x120E_0000. 25 registers extracted programmatically from the Hi3521A/Hi3520D V300 data sheet (Issue 00B07, 2015-12-10) (Table 3-20 Summary of PMC registers (base address: 0x120E_0000)): register headings, offsets, total reset values, field bit ranges, access types, names, reset values and descriptions, with PDF page numbers in each register description. Field names, bit ranges, access types and offsets are exact; the free-text descriptions are taken from the cell text of the field table and were checked by sampling only. Hardware not verified.";
